# Real player replay logs (names/chat messages are real, other people's user
# data) used to be excluded here by default. testdata/replays_batch/ and
# testdata/gt_batch/ are now tracked deliberately - the test suite
# (run_test_suite.py) needs them present to be runnable on a fresh clone
# without also having a Warband install + replays.7z on hand. Anyone
# re-generating this from their own replays.7z should consider whether they
# want those other players' names/chat committed to a public repo before
# doing the same.
testdata/*.7z
testdata/*.xz
testdata/test_suite_results.json

# Generated by scripts/gen_canonical_sql_header.py from the committed .sql
# source at build time - not itself a source file, regenerate via `make`.
sql/*_sql.h

# Python bytecode cache - machine-local, regenerated on demand.
testdata/__pycache__/

.claude